  "body": "Set on an approx. 587 sqm section with a 209 sqm floor area, this 4-bedroom home offers 3 living spaces and 2.5 bathrooms. Its practical two-level layout makes it a great choice for growing families.\r\n\r\nThe main level features a separate lounge, an open-plan kitchen and dining area. The kitchen offers plenty of bench space and good storage, while sliding doors open onto a balcony with lovely open views, perfect for relaxing. A separate guest toilet adds convenience. The master bedroom is also on this level, with an ensuite and walk-in\r\nwardrobe.\r\n\r\nDownstairs offers three bedrooms, a family bathroom and a separate living area opening onto the deck. There is also a cosy sitting area that could be used as a study, plus under-stairs storage and a laundry nook.\r\n\r\nWhat Makes This Home Special:\r\n\r\n• Approx. 587 sqm section and 209 sqm floor area\r\n\r\n• 4 bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms, including a master ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n\r\n• 3 living spaces across two levels\r\n\r\n• Modern kitchen with plenty of storage\r\n\r\n• Under-stairs storage and separate laundry\r\n\r\n• 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nSituated in the popular Millwater community, the home is conveniently located near great schools and Silverdale shopping centre. Orewa Beach and motorway access are also within easy reach.\r\n\r\nContact us today for a private viewing or come along to our open homes.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
